{"title":"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Stewart&#39;s_Theorem)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Stewart's Theorem)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/4/204f957f90cc34dd19937e216f02c5a38663869d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=DC$\" width=\"83\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/5/c25a1e0caafcceb2a2e11c0b2373e89f639f299d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADC=2\\angle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"147\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff2219e4b6351e8b0b3b3ba2294a9133e4bf38f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c68227ec2efd9339ffd16251b000f7b70017e121.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/0/3a0b75202202b36c2a62a22bba07fc06501bea7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/9/ae91af3e2d81f3568bd33c2a541f4fa3c28734d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=DB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/8/648e235267379ef3b96d7cf045f0fcfbf8cf1ecf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ADC = 2\\angle ABC,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" /> we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is a right triangle with a right angle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa25d66079f4705ebc8187fa77da459d929b52fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> thus by the Pythagorean Theorem we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/1/8c19b2086937db40298aa8e7eca106711c09454e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=\\boxed{24}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"89\" height=\"25\" /> ~samrocksnature\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Stewart.27s_Theorem.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Stewart's_Theorem)\">Solution 2 (Stewart's Theorem)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Stewart&#39;s Theorem)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/f/b9f1a6b8938f9c3d1d5bd03af7a9e2f2a61ae4a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BDC = 180-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"16\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/8/6b875283c3bcfd0778956a92d7d4331eeb678dfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DCB = \\angle DBC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"141\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/47390be838961be4b97e8c29c993a56ae6aa13db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=DB=DC=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"182\" height=\"14\" />. Now, Stewart's Theorem dictates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/0/8d0c574b86c358852a4c7055e430c47781ba03c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 \\cdot 13 = 7488$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"17\" />, yielding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/0/700bb77db6b7772dc9cab7234a675baa85eed756.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=x=\\boxed{24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"118\" height=\"25\" /> ~Geometry285\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems\">Other 2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Answer Key\">2021 JMPSC Invitationals Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JMPSC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"JMPSC Problems and Solutions\">All JMPSC Problems and Solutions</a></li></ol>\n<p>The problems on this page are copyrighted by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://jmpsc.org\">Junior Mathematicians' Problem Solving Competition</a>. <span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:JMPSC.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/120px-JMPSC.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/180px-JMPSC.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/a/ab/JMPSC.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018020014\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 104/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 183/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3249/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    4.945      1 Template:JMPSC_Notice\n100.00%    4.945      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21637:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018020014 and revision id 270888. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}